  "query_preview": "..\n(Thursday through Sunday)\nIssued at 142 AM CDT Mon Jul 27 2026\n\nThe ridge will continue to meander westward into the desert \nsouthwest by this weekend. This will bring a pattern change aloft \nand stronger shortwaves and northwesterly flow aloft. A front is \nstill progged to move south across the area Friday, which will bring \na chance for \"cooler\" temperatures this weekend. By cooler, this \nmeans a break from the triple digit heat and widespread Heat \nAdvisories across much of the forecast area with near normal \ntemperatures for the start of August (mid to upper 90s). There is \nalso a chance that precipitation could accompany the frontal \npassage Friday, but these chances remain fairly low at this time.",
